{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["הכשית — that she is of the family of Ham." "כי אשה כשית לקח — as written in Chronicles, that Moshe Rabbenu was king in the land of Cush for forty years and took one of its queens, but did not lie with her, as stated there. And they, when they spoke against him, did not know that he had not had relations with her — this is the core of its plain sense. For if they spoke on account of Zipporah, what need is there to specify כי אשה כושית לקח, and is it until now that we did not know that Zipporah is a Midianite?! And there is a further answer: she was not a Cushite, for Cush is of the sons of Ham, while Midian is of the sons of Keturah, whom she bore to Abraham."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:49:59.525567845Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}